531
00:51:02,964 --> 00:51:04,032
Name of Fenton Lang.

532
00:51:04,532 --> 00:51:07,835
Langs of Tennessee, Polk County,
third generation,

533
00:51:07,936 --> 00:51:09,169
going all the way back

534
00:51:09,269 --> 00:51:11,438
