Oh Lord.

540
00:51:31,659 --> 00:51:36,463
I am prone to the sermon
I'm afraid.

541
00:51:37,999 --> 00:51:40,233
May I give you my testimony?

542
00:51:40,334 --> 00:51:42,202
-As long as it comes
