548
00:52:28,716 --> 00:52:32,787
It's a trade that goes back
generations in my family.

549
00:52:32,887 --> 00:52:34,789
You see,
the Polk County Langs

550
00:52:34,889 --> 00:52:39,192
have a proud tradition
more than a hundred years back

551
00:52:39,292 --> 00:52:45,165
of chasing down runaway slaves
in Tennessee

552
00:52:45,265 --> 00:52:48,069
and up into Kentucky.

553
00:52:48,803 --> 00:52:52,507
I was taught by my Daddy
and him by his.

554
00:52:52,607 --> 00:52:54,441
The patrol I was in
brought to account

555
00:52:54,542 --> 00:52:58,146
more than a hundred
of them runaways.

556
00:52:58,245 --> 00:53:01,481
I killed nine by my own hand.

557
00:53:03,551 --> 00:53:06,486
You know I was just
eighteen years old

558
00:53:06,587 --> 00:53:09,657
when I brought three members
of the Halifax Gang

559
00:53:09,757 --> 00:53:12,259
