575
00:54:19,861 --> 00:54:24,132
-You don't look like no
kinda' road agents, I reckon.

576
00:54:24,232 --> 00:54:25,633
-Willard LeRoy here.

577
00:54:25,733 --> 00:54:29,170
This here chawed up
scrap of weed's Emmett.

578
00:54:29,269 --> 00:54:31,139
-Evenin.'

579
00:54:31,239 --> 00:54:33,574
-Come on and warm yourself
by the fire.

580
00:54:33,674 --> 00:54:37,044
Help yourself to some
of this Arbuckle's.

581
00:54:37,879 --> 00:54:43,217
I find it to be an indispensable
