586
00:55:06,607 --> 00:55:11,212
-Arizona. Copper mine
outside of Smith's Mill.

587
00:55:11,311 --> 00:55:12,847
Promise of work there.

588
00:55:12,947 --> 00:55:15,183
-Hell of a long way
to come on one hoss.

589
00:55:15,283 --> 00:55:16,851
-We had a nice Tennessee
walking horse

590
00:55:16,951 --> 00:55:18,986
tore a ligament
outside of Greensburg,

591
00:55:19,086 --> 00:55:20,087
