592
00:55:29,664 --> 00:55:32,600
-He's as green as salt cedar!

593
00:55:37,538 --> 00:55:42,944
-Yeah... we're headed
to Arkansas by way of Wyoming.

594
00:55:43,044 --> 00:55:47,148
Changing world these days, you
make your living as a trapper.

595
00:55:47,248 --> 00:55:48,348
Fur done gone belly up,

596
00:55:48,448 --> 00:55:50,885
what with the Bison
