603
00:57:27,882 --> 00:57:32,653
Easy now, boy.
Keep them hands from drifting.

604
00:57:37,091 --> 00:57:38,659
-I don't understand...

605
00:57:38,759 --> 00:57:42,897
It's a thousand dollars, boy.
Don't take it personal.

