625
00:59:35,976 --> 00:59:37,244
-I don't wanna do this anymore,

626
00:59:37,344 --> 00:59:38,212
-I can't--
-Lucas--

627
00:59:38,312 --> 00:59:39,914
-I don't wanna do this anymore!

628
00:59:40,014 --> 00:59:42,083
I just want everything
