We give them their way,
they'll give us our way.

701
01:06:47,909 --> 01:06:51,144
I'm gonna send word
on to Masilla.

702
01:06:51,245 --> 01:06:52,580
Scare us up some chuck too,

703
01:06:52,680 --> 01:06:56,551
you're lookin' a little narrow
around the equator.

704
01:06:57,886 --> 01:06:59,353
What's that?

705
01:07:00,655 --> 01:07:01,221
-What?

706
01:07:01,455 --> 01:07:02,524
-What just come
outta your pocket.

707
01:07:02,624 --> 01:07:03,625
- <i>Nothing.</i>

708
01:07:03,992 --> 01:07:05,192
-Give it to me.
- I said it ain't nothing.

709
01:07:05,292 --> 01:07:07,461
I said give it to me.

710
01:07:12,567 --> 01:07:17,204
"Dear Jacob. I want you to know
that I am fine..."

711
01:07:17,304 --> 01:07:18,506
-Listen, I was just--

712
01:07:18,606 --> 01:07:19,507
-Damnit, boy!

713
01:07:19,674 --> 01:07:20,742
-I was just trying
to let him know I'm all right.

714
01:07:20,842 --> 01:07:22,376
-Have you lost your damn rudder,

715
01:07:22,544 --> 01:07:24,378
you send this, it would draw
a line straight back to us.

716
01:07:24,478 --> 01:07:25,412
-We ain't seen nobody coming--

717
01:07:25,513 --> 01:07:27,481
