outta here and you ride fast.

727
01:07:47,869 --> 01:07:49,837
You understand?

728
01:07:51,338 --> 01:07:53,508
Do you understand?

729
01:07:53,608 --> 01:07:55,342
-Yes.

730
01:08:47,895 --> 01:08:52,066
