746
01:11:26,053 --> 01:11:31,358
French as she is spoke.
A jest in sober earnest.

747
01:11:32,794 --> 01:11:36,463
I dead myself in envy
to see her.

748
01:11:36,564 --> 01:11:39,399
Je meurs d'envie de...

